"file": 37,
"paths": [
"d002/f653"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2106f48b",
"en_raw": "A painter who draws guardian spirits"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "cfc9d124",
"en_raw": "...Are you stupid?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "04f36cec",
"en_raw": "So what did Sanjo say?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a627791a",
"en_raw": "Not really..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "78215153",
"en_raw": "She said it was fun"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "2b4afae7",
"en_raw": "She's a weird person too"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "1208a0c7",
"en_raw": "Why is she so hyper"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "b3ab27e9",
"en_raw": "every single day?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "24409417",
"en_raw": "Sango just lacks motivation"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "2b04b274",
"en_raw": "My life"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "34448e2a",
"en_raw": "is often tiring"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "10814192",
"en_raw": "Anyway, since it's"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "9b148326",
"en_raw": "summer vacation"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "35991df3",
"en_raw": "let's go to the Wildflower Garden"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "40260644",
"en_raw": "It's almost evening already..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "f0c00068",
"en_raw": "The Wildflower Garden has lots of weirdos"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "cc94bcdf",
"en_raw": "I guess..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a9efafe8",
"en_raw": "I mean, there are people juggling"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "7f7057f4",
"en_raw": "instead of working"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "7c52a7a1",
"en_raw": "or selling strange stuff"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a35a55f8",
"en_raw": "that'll never sell"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "c21366e7",
"en_raw": "Well, yeah"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "c5771ffa",
"en_raw": "Thinking about it, a portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "c4e4bec3",
"en_raw": "who draws guardian spirits"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "1413409e",
"en_raw": "isn't all that"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "31a69a13",
"en_raw": "special"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "76e27353",
"en_raw": "Looks like we've gathered"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d98be161",
"en_raw": "info about the portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "b80c275f",
"en_raw": "What will you do, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "bdfce349",
"en_raw": "Get your portrait drawn?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "fbcd4555",
"en_raw": "Hmm, I'm"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "fbe97755",
"en_raw": "still torn"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "6060c2cc",
"en_raw": "If you don't like it"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "a5d6efba",
"en_raw": "you don't have to force yourself"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ef4b05d6",
"en_raw": "to get one, I think..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "dfd8a8b1",
"en_raw": "Well, for now"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "02ca1cac",
"en_raw": "I'll hear it"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "c694c081",
"en_raw": "from the artist first"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3083e855",
"en_raw": "What's up?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c50c3442",
"en_raw": "Sango, you're in a good mood"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "2c1db9d6",
"en_raw": "Hee hee"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "ba121376",
"en_raw": "My treasures have increased"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7e9ce4d2",
"en_raw": "Oh, it's the portrait"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "b6a74c45",
"en_raw": "Oh, it's..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "521f7eba",
"en_raw": "Kids like you"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "dde1ec5a",
"en_raw": "I can't keep up with"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "7f956e5b",
"en_raw": "What"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "7ac1c37e",
"en_raw": "Why do people cling"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "90389fce",
"en_raw": "to being human?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "18d2d3db",
"en_raw": "...That picture"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "dcca63b4",
"en_raw": "shows this planet's future"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "3a258dc0",
"en_raw": "and how people should be"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "88548c7f",
"en_raw": "It looks pessimistic at first, but"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "6d084f3a",
"en_raw": "as one clearly hopeful guess"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "26c1b7bf",
"en_raw": "I don't understand at all"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "f8da469c",
"en_raw": "I've decided to change"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "52471853",
"en_raw": "We too"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "cf1f9dd1",
"en_raw": "should start thinking seriously"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "fd4f5ab6",
"en_raw": "about the future"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "f01ef833",
"en_raw": "Lucky Sango"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "21be3f4a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi should have"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "f2259fb7",
"en_raw": "gotten one too"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "9e7020a9",
"en_raw": "Absolutely not!"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "35d112b9",
"en_raw": "A portrait of Shiina"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "1dd99f8d",
"en_raw": "would be like Leonardo da Vinci"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "dea8f240",
"en_raw": "for a cat"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "bb36b720",
"en_raw": "You mustn't make him waste"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "15016f8a",
"en_raw": "his sublime act of drawing"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "b36ff097",
"en_raw": "on such a trendy whim"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "42b6643e",
"en_raw": "What's gotten into you, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "6ecb8e46",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Nao"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "3c533df3",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants a portrait too!"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "dfd1fd48",
"en_raw": "Whether or not we get"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "dfc3e834",
"en_raw": "Shiina's portrait drawn"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "d1f822d0",
"en_raw": "it's fine to stop by again"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "70b725be",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "f0746bf3",
"en_raw": "Yeah yeah, let's go!"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "f0079307",
"en_raw": "I wonder what his name is"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "37fb1e6e",
"en_raw": "He never tells us"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "1dfacecc",
"en_raw": "anything about himself..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "3792836f",
"en_raw": "Just like..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "d5a83e25",
"en_raw": "Just like, that's it!"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "b3397bff",
"en_raw": "Like Tomoki!"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "615efc8c",
"en_raw": "To think someone like that"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "f9da7c0a",
"en_raw": "was in Hirumi too..."
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "57b548aa",
"en_raw": "You never know who you'll meet"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "7939bd44",
"en_raw": "Who are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "c03fcb7b",
"en_raw": "The portrait artist"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "f8524685",
"en_raw": "obviously, dummy"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "82d84d21",
"en_raw": "Will Kurumi's picture be done tomorrow?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "a71cfa72",
"en_raw": "Probably"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "23f06d5a",
"en_raw": "The last one was done quickly"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "97d59607",
"en_raw": "In Shiina's case she has long hair"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "1ca6d8bf",
"en_raw": "and wears a straw hat"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "2d7985b2",
"en_raw": "so there's a lot to draw"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "33ea258c",
"en_raw": "and it's a pain"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "126d44af",
"en_raw": "When will Kurumi's picture be done?"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "cbb70dab",
"en_raw": "The last one was quick"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "16fc6f67",
"en_raw": "About one more day, probably"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "a71cfa72",
"en_raw": "Probably"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "cf7aea1b",
"en_raw": "Well, who knows"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "0cc6a282",
"en_raw": "It might take a while"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "9a62facd",
"en_raw": "He seems to like her"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "38a4068e",
"en_raw": "as a motif"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "d86fa943",
"en_raw": "...Kurumi Shiina, today"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "8c503c52",
"en_raw": "come to my studio"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "75128f38",
"en_raw": "he might say"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "7bb8f5a4",
"en_raw": "Then what do you do, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "53652e2b",
"en_raw": "What was that about, 'people can't"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "d92ed524",
"en_raw": "live like this'?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "ae0e64db",
"en_raw": "Totally misjudged"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "76101f5d",
"en_raw": "But shouldn't we have him"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "97b0926b",
"en_raw": "finish it?"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "7f286689",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "412c7530",
"en_raw": "paid money too"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "e757bd6e",
"en_raw": "Then, Nao"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "1b9eea0a",
"en_raw": "You can just tell Shiina"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "5f875b7c",
"en_raw": "and make her understand, right?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "4b3198da",
"en_raw": "See you tomorrow!"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "2e99d448",
"en_raw": "See you again tomorrow!"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "19d03651",
"en_raw": "It's a bit strange"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "73b2ca87",
"en_raw": "that it's taking this long"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "6849397c",
"en_raw": "He was strange from the start"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "b27b1ac4",
"en_raw": "that man"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "d69ede19",
"en_raw": "Maybe Shiina really is"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "3c734501",
"en_raw": "something special..."
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "6a5d0093",
"en_raw": "That's a discriminatory remark"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "4b91a08d",
"en_raw": "When will Kurumi's picture be done?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "19d03651",
"en_raw": "It's a bit strange"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "73b2ca87",
"en_raw": "that it's taking this long"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "6849397c",
"en_raw": "He was strange from the start"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "b27b1ac4",
"en_raw": "that man"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "ad7c03a4",
"en_raw": "Hope it's done this time"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "41cead71",
"en_raw": "If not, it's fraud"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "774be547",
"en_raw": "But I'm sure it'll turn out"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "60467316",
"en_raw": "to be a good picture"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "95b594b9",
"en_raw": "Well, she looks good"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "c793d026",
"en_raw": "Shiina, you know..."
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "bb45b8dd",
"en_raw": "Ugh, so everyone is"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "83a2489f",
"en_raw": "into looks after all"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "78ba4734",
"en_raw": "...Tch"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "3a7beeb6",
"en_raw": "Do you think we should"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "a137dcb4",
"en_raw": "have him finish it?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "6ef0ec9d",
"en_raw": "Don't know"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "e6fd374f",
"en_raw": "Do what you like, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "2959ed91",
"en_raw": "He seems to like you"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "cc234ea1",
"en_raw": "'Draws guardian spirits,' my foot"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "e338b879",
"en_raw": "No matter how you look at it"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "4419bb1a",
"en_raw": "this is a drawing of a cat, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "16a3d742",
"en_raw": "But he seemed pretty unwell"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "e089d2bc",
"en_raw": "toward the end"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "757430f6",
"en_raw": "Maybe food poisoning?"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "182413ba",
"en_raw": "Or an excuse for not being able to draw"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "c499d548",
"en_raw": "So do you think"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "c554cf92",
"en_raw": "he fooled us?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "93cc191d",
"en_raw": "Hmm, fooled us..."
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "60e476f0",
"en_raw": "Rather than fooled..."
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "fb4c4c6e",
"en_raw": "This is how it is"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "49338225",
"en_raw": "They call it cultural investment"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "1c40497d",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Portrait Artist"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "a085553d",
"en_raw": "Since then, nobody has seen"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "82612fc6",
"en_raw": "the young portrait artist at the garden..."
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "2e288cea",
"en_raw": "It's not like he's a ghost"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "da5c6ee8",
"en_raw": "He's probably drawing portraits"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "b7159467",
"en_raw": "in some park again"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "4883bb82",
"en_raw": "with trendy fans in tow"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}